error[E0806]: `Drink` is the variant `Kind.Drink`, and a `select` arm cannot test it
 --> mem:///main.lu:8:9
  |
1 | enum Kind { Drink, Food, Gratuity }
  |             ----- `Drink` is declared here, in `Kind`
...
8 |         Drink from ch => { got = 1 },
  |         ^^^^^ a receive cannot fail to match
  |
  = note: a committed receive takes whatever its channel delivers, so a `select` arm's pattern
    only binds. Receive into a name and test it in the arm's body: `drink from ch => match
    drink { Kind.Drink => …, _ => … }`.
help: bind it under a lowercase name: `drink`
  |
8 |         drink from ch => { got = 1 },
  |
